+config DECKLAB_RAM_ONLY_LOADER
+    bool "DeckLab RAM-only download environment"
+    depends on TARGET_SPACEMIT_K3
+    default n
+    help
+      Enter the USB fastboot loop before normal late board initialization.
+      Skip identity provisioning, DDR-training persistence and automatic
+      SD/USB image flashing. This image is only for RAM staging by DeckLab.
